{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sapphire-32","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sapphire-32-evolutions-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Sapphire 32 - a luxury project by Evolutions, the developer of which is Dar Al Karama Real Estate. The complex is located in the heart of JVC and is a 27-storey tower with 5 podiums, the design of which combines luxury and modern urban style. The apartments for sale include 1-3 bedroom apartments with views of the cityscape.Residents are presented with a variety of world-class amenities, among which everyone can find an activity to their liking. A swimming pool, several outdoor gyms and a fitness center will help you maintain a healthy lifestyle. For children there is a playground and a small swimming pool, and you can relax in the cozy garden, where there are places for rest and a large number of walking paths. There is also an on-site prayer room, 24-hour security and parking. There are supermarkets, schools, restaurants and a large Circle Mall nearby.JVC is conveniently located next to Mohammed Bin Zayed, the city's main thoroughfare, making it a 15-minute drive from Sapphire 32 to Palm Jumeirah and Burj Al Arab, and a 20-minute drive to Dubai Mall and Burj Al Arab. Al Maktoum International Airport is a 30-minute drive away.Sapphire 32 is the perfect place for couples, young professionals and those who want to enjoy comfort and convenience in the heart of the hustle and bustle of the city.","price":754846,"title":"Sapphire 32","bitrix":{"id":960,"pf_id":"are.2.13204","source":null,"project_id":"Sapphire 32","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sapphire 32","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Evolutions","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/516/images/2023/10/25/340x252/IJFNgyXAwopv5CjlNvQlF0Ih4ZkGhFsIUphnAzQG.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.